{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在那之后……", "text_idx": 84, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼、呼、再、再怎么说也够了吧，\\n　全身酥酥麻麻的而且也很害羞……」", "text_idx": 86, "plain": "「呼、呼、再、再怎么说也够了吧，　全身酥酥麻麻的而且也很害羞……」", "plain_idx": 87, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6762", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们就这样脱了衣服洗了个澡，\\n然后直接钻进了被窝。", "text_idx": 92, "plain": "我们就这样脱了衣服洗了个澡，然后直接钻进了被窝。", "plain_idx": 93, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，我温柔地抱住了纱凪，\\n开始专心摸起她的头来。", "text_idx": 94, "plain": "然后，我温柔地抱住了纱凪，开始专心摸起她的头来。", "plain_idx": 95, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——至少现在得对她温柔些。", "text_idx": 96, "plain": "——至少现在得对她温柔些。", "plain_idx": 96, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘴上这么说，却一点也不抵抗呢，纱凪」", "text_idx": 97, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还不是因为我被某人给迷得神魂颠倒了啊」", "text_idx": 98, "plain": "「还不是因为我被某人给迷得神魂颠倒了啊」", "plain_idx": 98, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6763", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且你一副很想摸的样子……\\n　我只是无可奈何，才让你摸的♪」", "text_idx": 100, "plain": "「而且你一副很想摸的样子……　我只是无可奈何，才让你摸的♪」", "plain_idx": 101, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6764", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……很舒服，而且让人安心」", "text_idx": 103, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6765", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……疼疼疼」", "text_idx": 105, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6766", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……纱凪、难道说……」", "text_idx": 107, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉……怎么说呢，身体稍微恢复了点力气，\\n　就不由得会注意到那里……」", "text_idx": 108, "plain": "「抱歉……怎么说呢，身体稍微恢复了点力气，　就不由得会注意到那里……」", "plain_idx": 109, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6767", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……要道歉的是我啊」", "text_idx": 111, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没什么好道歉的吧。刚刚也说过了，\\n　我们是互相都希望如此才做的」", "text_idx": 112, "plain": "「没什么好道歉的吧。刚刚也说过了，　我们是互相都希望如此才做的」", "plain_idx": 113, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6768", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女孩子第一次会痛是很正常的，\\n　也没办法啊」", "text_idx": 115, "plain": "「女孩子第一次会痛是很正常的，　也没办法啊」", "plain_idx": 116, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6769", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，要是我做得不那么激烈。", "text_idx": 118, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我难以避免地这么想。", "text_idx": 119, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至少，在纱凪的疼痛缓解之前，\\n绝对不能做第二回……", "text_idx": 120, "plain": "至少，在纱凪的疼痛缓解之前，绝对不能做第二回……", "plain_idx": 121, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 122, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——不对，说到底。", "text_idx": 123, "plain": "——不对，说到底。", "plain_idx": 123, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在纱凪主动渴求之前，我还是忍着吧。\\n总觉得我这边主动要求也不好。", "text_idx": 124, "plain": "在纱凪主动渴求之前，我还是忍着吧。总觉得我这边主动要求也不好。", "plain_idx": 125, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是我又失去理性变得和野兽一样，\\n然后被纱凪责备……这可不行……", "text_idx": 126, "plain": "要是我又失去理性变得和野兽一样，然后被纱凪责备……这可不行……", "plain_idx": 127, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说了。不用在意的」", "text_idx": 128, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6770", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是觉得只有自己舒服而感到抱歉，\n　那作为赔礼，就是……啾……啾」", "text_idx": 130, "plain": "「你要是觉得只有自己舒服而感到抱歉，\n　那作为赔礼，就是……啾……啾」", "plain_idx": 130, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6771", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啾」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔嗯、嗯嗯……？！啾、啾、唔唔、\\n　啾……啾唔、嗯嗯、唔……唔……♪」", "text_idx": 133, "plain": "「唔嗯、嗯嗯……？！啾、啾、唔唔、　啾……啾唔、嗯嗯、唔……唔……♪」", "plain_idx": 134, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6772", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……亲、亲过头啦，笨蛋……诶嘿嘿」", "text_idx": 136, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6773", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不喜欢吗？」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你又说这种话……\\n　怎么会不喜欢啊，倒不如说——」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": "「你又说这种话……　怎么会不喜欢啊，倒不如说——」", "plain_idx": 140, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6774", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我要是不喜欢，我也……\\n　我、我也不会把最重要的第一次交给你啊」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": "「我要是不喜欢，我也……　我、我也不会把最重要的第一次交给你啊」", "plain_idx": 143, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6775", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪……唔」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、唔、啾……唔呼、唔呼、\\n　又亲了……啾、嗯啾、啾、啾」", "text_idx": 146, "plain": "「啊、唔、啾……唔呼、唔呼、　又亲了……啾、嗯啾、啾、啾」", "plain_idx": 147, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6776", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼啊……嘿、嘿嘿嘿……♪」", "text_idx": 149, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6777", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "停止接吻之后，纱凪露出无比开心的表情\\n把脸靠向了我。", "text_idx": 151, "plain": "停止接吻之后，纱凪露出无比开心的表情把脸靠向了我。", "plain_idx": 152, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……再做更多，就像刚才一样……」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6778", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以吗……？」", "text_idx": 155, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然很害羞，但是能切身体会到，\\n　你在珍惜着我……」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": "「虽然很害羞，但是能切身体会到，　你在珍惜着我……」", "plain_idx": 157, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6779", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。让我珍惜你吧」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿……今天是特別的……♪」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6780", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过已经是第二天了」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎、啊，真的呢？！」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6781", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽、虽然这话不该由我来说，\\n　新吾，你今天不用回家吗……？！」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": "「虽、虽然这话不该由我来说，　新吾，你今天不用回家吗……？！」", "plain_idx": 166, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6782", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我怎么能放着这么可爱的女友不管，自己一个人回去啊」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哈、呜」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6783", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这、这种说法，也不错呢……再说点……」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6784", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天樱乃住在濑名同学家里，\\n　所以不用在意那么多的」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": "「今天樱乃住在濑名同学家里，　所以不用在意那么多的」", "plain_idx": 174, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这、这样啊……」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6785", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那、那干脆……如果，\\n　你愿意的话，要不……」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": "「……那、那干脆……如果，　你愿意的话，要不……」", "plain_idx": 178, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6786", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起待到……早上……？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6787", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……瞬间，我陷入了思考。", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，纱凪眼里明确流露出了强烈的渴望。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "不过，纱凪眼里明确流露出了强烈的渴望。", "plain_idx": 183, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要好好睡觉哦」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我睡我睡我睡！\\n　你会、会和我一起睡吧？！」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": "「我睡我睡我睡！　你会、会和我一起睡吧？！」", "plain_idx": 186, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6788", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……当然」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，没事的。\\n我现在能忍住。", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "嗯，没事的。我现在能忍住。", "plain_idx": 190, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不会再次失去理智了。", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……还能和新吾一起睡，\\n　今天已经被各种第一次填满了……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "「啊……还能和新吾一起睡，　今天已经被各种第一次填满了……」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6789", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「都说了，已经是第二天了」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这些小细节就别管了，\\n　在睡醒之前都是今天」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "「这些小细节就别管了，　在睡醒之前都是今天」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6790", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为是平安夜，这些事都是能被原谅的」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6791", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……纱凪的心里，\\n似乎也有着平安夜的魔法。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "……纱凪的心里，似乎也有着平安夜的魔法。", "plain_idx": 202, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是这样，再来点、新吾再来点♪」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6792", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你真的有打算睡觉吗？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜嗷！」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6793", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉、看见纱凪这么可爱忍不住就」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟是平安夜，我就原谅你吧……♪」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6794", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、疼疼疼」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6795", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……为了你能好受一些，\\n　无论多少次……我都会温柔地对待你的」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「嗯……为了你能好受一些，　无论多少次……我都会温柔地对待你的」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯♪\\n　圣诞礼物，要给我很多哦……？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「……嗯♪　圣诞礼物，要给我很多哦……？」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6796", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这种上挑的眼神也很可爱……\\n　不过，现在能先闭上眼吗？」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「你这种上挑的眼神也很可爱……　不过，现在能先闭上眼吗？」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……啾、啾♪」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6797", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿嘿……光是今天一天，亲吻的次数就已经\\n　超过了至今以来的总数呢，感觉脑子里就只剩亲吻了呢……♪」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "「嘿嘿嘿……光是今天一天，亲吻的次数就已经　超过了至今以来的总数呢，感觉脑子里就只剩亲吻了呢……♪」", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6798", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今晚，在各种意义上都是一生难忘……\\n　嘿嘿、哎嘿嘿……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「今晚，在各种意义上都是一生难忘……　嘿嘿、哎嘿嘿……」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6799", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾，你觉得怎么样？\\n　是不是也觉得……今天晚上和我在一起，一生难忘？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「……新吾，你觉得怎么样？　是不是也觉得……今天晚上和我在一起，一生难忘？」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6800", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可能会忘啊」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——对。今天发生的事情，\\n在各种意义上都难以忘记。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": "——对。今天发生的事情，在各种意义上都难以忘记。", "plain_idx": 233, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也不能忘记。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈……成功了！\\n　也让新吾为我神魂颠倒了一回♪～」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「哈哈……成功了！　也让新吾为我神魂颠倒了一回♪～」", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6801", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼、嘻嘻嘻嘻……哈～\\n　好开心、好幸福啊……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "「哼、嘻嘻嘻嘻……哈～　好开心、好幸福啊……」", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6802", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪微笑着，在我眼中真是无比可爱、惹人怜爱。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我，满怀爱意抱紧了她，\\n无数次地吻她、摸她的头，让她高兴。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "所以我，满怀爱意抱紧了她，无数次地吻她、摸她的头，让她高兴。", "plain_idx": 243, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……♪呼、呼呼呼、嘻嘻嘻嘻～……」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn6803", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，纱凪的身体似乎也在说着“我还要”一般，\\n更加紧贴着我……", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "然后，纱凪的身体似乎也在说着“我还要”一般，更加紧贴着我……", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们就这样紧贴着，\\n睡到了早上……", "text_idx": 248, "plain": "我们就这样紧贴着，睡到了早上……", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
